.qa

# Normalised external assets. These are build output, but they are also what
# the browser actually downloads, so they ship alongside public/assets/glb/
# rather than being regenerated on deploy. The `build` rule above would
# otherwise swallow them.
!public/assets/external/build/
!public/assets/external/build/**
